[{"title":"无题","author":"林灵素","text":"苏黄不作文章客，童蔡翻为社稷臣。\n三十年来无定论，不知奸党是何人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":137,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游天坛","author":"林灵素","text":"摆脱尘缨淡无欲，闲阅图经寻岳渎。\n林泉何处惬予心，收拾琴书将卜筑。\n崎岖不敢千里辞，东至太行人王屋。\n先探藏花坞里春，蟠桃毕竟何时熟。\n燕萝故宅阳台宫，九龙戏珠画屏簇。\n丹井沉沉寝月明，丫髻仙童把参斸。\n昂头贪看华盖峰，蓦然误入紫微谷。\n上方楼阁与云闲，金碧交辉射林麓。\n远尘沟有远尘人，夜半闻歌采芝曲。\n策杖穷跻瘦龙岭，险似剑阁西向蜀。\n扪参历井上冲冥，千剑断崖横独木。\n自辰及酉脚力穷，恰到紫金堂下宿。\n再拜新尝太乙泉，顿觉洒然消病骨。\n褰衣竟入南天门，回首乾坤小蛮触。\n恍兮惚兮九霄间，万顷岚光醒醉目。\n银座金腰玉顶寒，帝遣仙官分部属。\n小有中藏万里地，都压洞大三十六。\n日精月华左右奇，黛色倚空如削玉。\n东观大海日轮红，西望穷边坛影绿。\n炼丹炉下土犹香，抱出神丹知几斛。\n巡山使者持太阿，保护神宫谁敢黩。\n王母洞深非可测，雷霆屡震蛟龙窟。\n遥指三官校勘台，樵人几度闻丝竹。\n抱朴岩前采药童，手撚金芝身薜服。\n北斗平联北斗星，自是天关通地轴。\n麻笼药匮翠相连，瑞草灵苗香馥郁。\n一声长啸坐孤石，紫云悠悠送黄鹄。\n个中煞是麻姑仙，冷笑世间光景促。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":138,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"林灵素","text":"政和丁酉西风秋，天子赐以骑青牛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":139,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释法灯","text":"耳底泉声，眼前山色。\n檐头雨滴，篱畔黄华。\n嗈嗈新雁唳南云，片片亭梧红满地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":140,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"投海偈二首 其一","author":"释净元","text":"我舍世间如梦，众人须我作颂。\n颂即语言边事，了取自家真梦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":141,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"投海偈二首 其二","author":"释净元","text":"世间人心易了，只为人多不晓。\n了即皎在目前，未了千般学道。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":142,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辞众偈","author":"释净元","text":"会得祖师真妙诀，无得无物又无说。\n喝散乌云千万重，一点灵心明皎洁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":143,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"卢法原","text":"若要少年并美貌，须还下部小尚书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":144,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梵隐院方丈梅","author":"晏敦复","text":"桠槛攲檐一古梅，几番有意唤春回。\n开花自许清香入，布叶不容炎暑来。\n日射冷光侵几案，风摇翠影锁莓苔。\n游蜂野蝶休相顾，木性从来不染埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":145,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同云叟道人季西弟宿祈泽寺晨起示以此诗","author":"赵㠓","text":"道人自捲衣，欲往夫子林。\n形瘦若鹳鹤，复作鹳鹤音。\n此音久不已，扰我清静心。\n听尔纵好语，鼎足三竹簪。\n松扃启虚晓，将见晨曦侵。\n霜风满招提，出望青烟岑。\n从君行逾年，壮我方外吟。\n会须速招隐，脱身事幽寻。\n尚为城郭叟，愧尔壁间琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":146,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云叟道人自夫子林骤款段先我而归口占一诗戏之","author":"赵㠓","text":"道人乘款段，辄尔驰山川。\n翻然两角巾，似与风争颠。\n左手不停勒，右手复争鞭。\n乌裙拍马腋，欲拟鹤升天。\n释耕观者人，莫知所以然。\n定疑云路阔，坠落骑鹿仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":147,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释清素","text":"颠倒颠，颠倒颠，新妇骑驴阿家牵。\n便恁么，太无端，回头不觉布衫穿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":148,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临终偈","author":"释清素","text":"木人备舟，铁人备马。\n丙丁童子稳稳登，喝散白云归去也。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":149,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其一","author":"闻人祥正","text":"五夜漏声催晓箭，曈曈初日照楼台。\n九天阊阖开宫殿，玉帛朝元万国来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":150,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其二","author":"闻人祥正","text":"春风院院落花堆，花气浓薰入酒杯。\n日千殿头宣索鲙，小舟撑出柳阴来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":151,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其三","author":"闻人祥正","text":"清明时节好烟光，柳苑春深百草芳。\n一夜汉宫传蜡烛，柳边新火起严妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":152,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其四","author":"闻人祥正","text":"内人相续报花开，天子春游特地来。\n夜半宴归宫漏永，沸天宵鼓动瑶台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":153,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其五","author":"闻人祥正","text":"绣衣鸂鶒浴回塘，风动荷花水殿香。\n坐对芳尊不知热，冰肌玉骨自清凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":154,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其六","author":"闻人祥正","text":"耿耿银河欲曙天，数声鸡唱锦楼前。\n君王晓坐金銮殿，绣被焚香独自眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":155,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其七","author":"闻人祥正","text":"月傍蓬莱汉阁残，玉阶仙杖拥千官。\n侍臣缓步归青琐，辨色争朝咫尺颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":156,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其八","author":"闻人祥正","text":"羯鼓声高众乐停，上林仙景似蓬瀛。\n轻云阁雨迎天仗，花外风飘万岁声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":157,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其九","author":"闻人祥正","text":"牡丹移向苑中栽，借得东风一夜开。\n尽日君王看不足，芳尊宜命管弦来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":158,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其十","author":"闻人祥正","text":"月倚觚棱宿雾收，三千珠翠拥宸游。\n霓旌影乱箫声远，天子龙舆过玉楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":159,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其十一","author":"闻人祥正","text":"碧纱窗下水沈烟，香入薰炉禁火天。\n最是一年春好处，绿杨高映画秋千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":160,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其十二","author":"闻人祥正","text":"连夜琼林散舞衣，披香新殿斗腰肢。\n今朝却得君王顾，从此新承恩泽时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":161,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其十三","author":"闻人祥正","text":"内人晓起怯春寒，惆怅阶前红牡丹。\n整了翠鬟匀了面，沈香亭北倚阑干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":162,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其十四","author":"闻人祥正","text":"珠帘约住牡丹风，金殿香销翠绮栊。\n应作巫阳春梦句，日高犹睡绿窗中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":163,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其十五","author":"闻人祥正","text":"淡淡梳妆薄薄脂，自然富贵出天姿。\n一朝选在君王侧，宫女三千尽妒伊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":164,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其十六","author":"闻人祥正","text":"玉壶传箭咽铜龙，金殿当头紫阁重。\n阊阖开门朝百辟，未央月晓度疏钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":165,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其十七","author":"闻人祥正","text":"珠箔轻明拂玉墀，汉宫仙掌露淋漓。\n金钗坠鬓分行立，等候官家未出时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":166,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其十八","author":"闻人祥正","text":"学画蛾眉独出群，越罗巴锦不胜春。\n承恩数上南熏殿，无奈宫中妒杀人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":167,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其十九","author":"闻人祥正","text":"春风先发苑中梅，愿春君王万寿杯。\n舞罢霓裳归苑去，箫声犹绕凤皇台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":168,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其二十","author":"闻人祥正","text":"帝宫三五戏春台，玉漏铜壶且莫催。\n百辟九霄环帝座，六鳌海上驾山来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":169,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其二十一","author":"闻人祥正","text":"东华金阙万重开，何处闻灯不看来。\n行幸未停歌未发，君王又进紫霞杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":170,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其二十二","author":"闻人祥正","text":"朝光瑞气满宫楼，一例珠帘不下钩。\n认得圣颜遥望见，香烟欲傍衮龙浮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":171,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其二十三","author":"闻人祥正","text":"清晓妆成寒食天，芙蓉深院斗秋千。\n君王未起珠帘捲，房里围棋懒自眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":172,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其二十四","author":"闻人祥正","text":"长眉画了绣帘开，榆火新传蜡炬来。\n扑蝶西围随伴走，晚归多是看花回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":173,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其二十五","author":"闻人祥正","text":"翠髻高丛绿鬓虚，娉娉袅袅十三馀。\n未央宫里三千女，捲上珠帘总不如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":174,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其二十六","author":"闻人祥正","text":"道字娇讹苦未成，淡蛾羞敛不胜情。\n有时歌罢下阶砌，闲把宫花独自行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":175,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句 其二十七","author":"闻人祥正","text":"黄金阁子锁牙床，不是愁人也断肠。\n帘日已高三丈透，铜炉谩炷一铢香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":176,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建炎丞相成国吕忠穆公退老堂诗 其一","author":"韩肖胄","text":"两持魁柄辅皇图，退隐林泉岁再除。\n勋烈早推戡难际，精神不减渡江初。\n遥知台岳灵仙窟，雅称磻溪将相居。\n好在先声震南楚，一堂风月暂踌躇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":177,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建炎丞相成国吕忠穆公退老堂诗 其二","author":"韩肖胄","text":"煌煌衮绣伫归周，卜筑宁容便退休。\n济上风烟移仿佛，浙东山水占深幽。\n清樽□□□□□，□□□□□□□。\n□□□□□□□，知公志在复神州。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":178,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释慧素","text":"一坏一不坏，笑杀观自在。\n师子蓦咬人，狂狗尽逐块。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":179,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临终偈","author":"释慧素","text":"昨夜风雷忽尔，露柱生出两指。\n天明笑倒灯笼，拄杖依前扶起。\n拂子?跳过流沙，夺转胡僧一只履。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":180,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释惟足","text":"奔流渡刃，疾焰过风，已是鹞子过新罗。\n倒拈蝎尾，逆捋虎须，作死马医了。\n移星换斗，倒岳倾湫，却较些子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":181,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释德宏","text":"上士相逢击石火，迸出流星眨眼过。\n是渠成佛已多时，堪笑痴禅黑处坐。\n阿呵呵，冥然作梦几时休，守却饭箩空忍饿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":182,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"常某","text":"水清讵免双螯黑，秋老难逃一背红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":183,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独山桥","author":"俞?","text":"十里东郊正税骖，清泉白石路曾谙。\n野田水碓都舂雪，山市炊烟半杂岚。\n俗美儿童归塾读，时和父老趁墟谈。\n远游何事追禽向，便拟村中著草庵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":184,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"参陪使骑祗谒真祠偶成小诗拜呈知府屯田","author":"于巽","text":"千骑骖驔出禁城，真祠款谒罄虔诚。\n裤襦载路歌仁政，箫鼓喧天乐太平。\n残雪未消山下路，和风先飏马前旌。\n为民祈祷多灵应，来岁丰穰定有成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":185,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和于巽祗谒真祠","author":"尚佐均","text":"踏霜投晓赛祠廷，豪竹繁弦妙吐诚。\n嘉客满筵青眼看，远山数点白云平。\n浅霞漏日迎前骑，轻吹含烟猎后旌。\n好处画工传不尽，只凭诗笔为摹成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":186,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和于巽祗谒真祠","author":"王需","text":"真人庙食占兹城，欲乞丰年在至诚。\n五马二车恭款谒，丰香烈火报登平。\n犬鸡仙去遗丹灶，鸾鹤飞来认翠旌。\n既就金方留世子，终闻玉帝录功成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":187,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和于巽祗谒真祠","author":"王允中","text":"缥缈仙台俯郡城，躬修祠事表精诚。\n天边雾卷山峰出，涧下风轻水面平。\n不为寻春驰五马，聊因劝课驻双旌。\n风流别乘多才调，彩笔先挥秀句成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":188,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和于巽祗谒真祠","author":"张介夫","text":"曈曈晓日照重城，车骑翩翩布德诚。\n绰约仙姿随世远，依俙楼观与云平。\n神灵响答歆香火，民庶欢呼拥旆旌。\n瑞雪呈祥和气洽，行看阖境报嘉成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":189,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和于巽祗谒真祠","author":"张鲂","text":"仙翁旧隐寄岩扃，千里蒙休合荐诚。\n菽粟有馀民暇逸，雨旸无爽气和平。\n箫笙缓缓陈觞豆，耆艾纷纷逐旆旌。\n灵迹欲知垂不朽，使君妙制刻初成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":190,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和于巽祗谒真祠","author":"高钧","text":"二公祠事出重城，宜有休祥答至诚。\n林壑静深经雪后，楼台高下与云平。\n丰年箫鼓来仙宅，晴日烟霞上使旌。\n黎庶欢声自偕乐，但闻高廪颂周成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":191,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辞众颂","author":"释了證","text":"来时本无，去亦非有。\n珍重诸人，月明清昼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":192,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠徐师川","author":"王模","text":"当日佥邪皆误国，先生奋髯叱昌奴。\n一门忠节凭孤立，千载纲常赖力扶。\n直道原来师柳下，高风久已属东湖。\n诗名四海犹馀事，也入紫薇宗派图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":193,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋四时景画 春","author":"李錞","text":"九江应共五湖连，尺素能开万里天。\n山杏野桃零落处，分明寒食晓风前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":194,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋四时景画 夏","author":"李錞","text":"繁阴杂树映汀沙，三伏江天自一家。\n欲唤扁舟渡云锦，平铺明镜是荷花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":195,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋四时景画 秋","author":"李錞","text":"舂锄寂寞绕疏丛，霜后云生浦溆风。\n此处年年报秋色，只应衰柳与丹枫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":196,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋四时景画 冬","author":"李錞","text":"剪水飞花细舞风，断芦洲外水连空。\n剡溪几曲知名处，何似今朝眼界中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":197,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雍丘怀古","author":"李錞","text":"雍丘西风鼓战尘，令狐抵死挠张巡。\n面当六矢无降色，惊讶雷公是木人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":198,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌","author":"李錞","text":"城头老乌尾毕逋，呀呀飞来声相呼。\n未央宫殿夜方徂，红靴玉带开金铺。\n宝蟾吐水石芙蕖，日奉君王同欢虞。\n舞衣香坠红氍毹，漏声琤琤滴铜壶。\n乌啼未已星渐无，炯炯烛龙上天衢。\n万年枝影转扶疏，峨峨当殿群臣趋，请上当时无逸图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":199,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早梅 其一","author":"李錞","text":"雪径清寒蝶未知，暗香谁遣好风吹。\n野桥漏泄春光处，正为横斜一两枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":200,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早梅 其二","author":"李錞","text":"雄蜂雌蝶两纷纷，梅子花香着莫人。\n风急落芙无藉在，已应先减几多春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":201,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"消梅","author":"李錞","text":"曾看寒花弄寒月，月下横斜袅香雪。\n才令诗眼散春愁，已见青青子争结。\n梦怀碧脆荐冰盘，细雨江南映远山。\n好事园林肯分我，不知尘土在长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":202,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕","author":"李錞","text":"银花火树已春容，贝阙珠宫十二重。\n席有嘉宾樽有酒，车如流水马如龙。\n旌旗影暖烘宵烛，笳鼓声喧侵晓钟。\n行乐岂关吾辈事，梦回推枕起犹慵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":203,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"李錞","text":"绿净随时看上鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":204,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"李錞","text":"散尽平生眼中客，暖风晴日闭门居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":205,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题颜鲁公画像","author":"徐俯","text":"公生开元间，壮及天宝乱。\n捐躯范阳兵，竟死蔡州叛。\n其贤似魏徵，天下非贞观。\n四帝数十年，一身逢百难。\n少时读书史，此事心已断。\n老来鬓发衰，慨叹功名晚。\n嗟哉忠义徒，捷去不可缓。\n初无当年悲，只令后世叹。\n一朝绝霖雨，南亩常亢旱。\n小人计虽得，斯民盖涂炭。\n长歌永君节，千载勇夫愞。\n敬书子张绅，庶几古人半。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":206,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"滕王阁 其一","author":"徐俯","text":"一日逢王造，千年与客游。\n云边梅岭出，坐上赣江流。\n日落回飞鸟，烟深失钓舟。\n蝉声枯柳外，天地晚风秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":207,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]